    "body": "**Description**\r\nV5.0.1 introduces a bug where connect request dialog is displayed even with privacy mode turned off. This issue was not present in v5.0.0\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Go to settings and disable privacy.\r\n2. Refresh the page.\r\n3. Notice Connect Request dialog\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe Connect Request dialog should not be displayed when privacy is turned off.\r\n\r\n**Browser details**\r\n - OS: Windows 10 Pro\r\n - Browser Chrome version 70.0.3538.77 (Official Build) (64-bit)\r\n - MetaMask Version 5.0.1\r\n - Beta UI\r\n\r\n",
